<& /page/page_title.mas, title=>"深圳農業基因組研究所 (AGIS) 番茄 360 重定序計畫(AGIS Tomato 360 Resequencing Project)" &>

<div class="page_introduction">
  由深圳農業基因組研究所進行的 360 個番茄種質基因組分析。(Genomic analysis of 360 tomato accessions by the Agricultural Genomic Institute at Shenzhen.)
</div>


<&| /page/info_section.mas, title => '360 個番茄基因組(360 Tomato Genomes)' &>
  基因組分析揭示了番茄育種歷史(Genomic analyses provide insights into the history of tomato breeding) <a href="http://www.nature.com/ng/journal/v46/n11/full/ng.3117.html">Lin et al. Nature Genetics, 2014</a><br />

  在 <a href="http://bti.cornell.edu/news/new-genomics-study-mines-360-tomato-varieties-to-trace-history-find-room-for-improvement/">BTI 網站(BTI web site)</a> 上查看有關該計畫的更多資訊。(See more info about the project on the BTI web site)

<br />

